peof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Underneath <a href=\"#/wiki/Malada\">Malada</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Talahu\">Talahu</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Bog%20Raider%20Cave\">Edron Bog Raider Cave</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonehome\">Stonehome</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Earth%20Elemental%20Cave\">Edron Earth Elemental Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Alchemist%20Quarter\">Alchemist Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth%2FCastle\">Vengoth Castle</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Robson%27s%20Isle\">Robson Isle</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond%20Hydra%2FBog%20Raider%20Cave\">Oramond Hydra/Bog Raider Cave</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA bog raider attacks in melee range. A bog raider never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Because Bog Raiders used to be a relatively weak monster, and gave relatively too much experience, in the Winter Update 2008 (half a year after their implementation) they became stronger and less profitable (loot is more rare now). They also glow green slightly since then. Their melee attack increased with approx. 60 damage and they received a Stalagmite-like attack dealing approx. 100 damage.\n</